{"title": "Quant Super Practice — Mock #73", "duration_min": 20.0, "questions": [{"q_en": "<p>A sum of Rs. 125 is lent by a child to his friend to be returned in 10 monthly installments of Rs. 13.75 each, the rate of interest is: </p>", "q_hi": "<p>&#2319;&#2325; &#2348;&#2330;&#2381;&#2330;&#2375; &#2344;&#2375; &#2309;&#2346;&#2344;&#2375; &#2342;&#2379;&#2360;&#2381;&#2340; &#2325;&#2379; 125 &#2352;&#2369;&#2346;&#2351;&#2375; &#2325;&#2368; &#2352;&#2366;&#2358;&#2367; 13.75 &#2352;&#2369;&#2346;&#2351;&#2375; &#2325;&#2368; 10 &#2350;&#2366;&#2360;&#2367;&#2325; &#2325;&#2367;&#2360;&#2381;&#2340;&#2379;&#2306; &#2350;&#2375;&#2306; &#2357;&#2366;&#2346;&#2360; &#2325;&#2352;&#2344;&#2375; &#2325;&#2375; &#2354;&#2367;&#2319; &#2313;&#2343;&#2366;&#2352; &#2342;&#2368;, &#2348;&#2381;&#2351;&#2366;&#2332; &#2325;&#2368; &#2342;&#2352; &#2361;&#2376;: </p>", "options_en": ["12%", "18%", "16%", "20%"], "options_hi": ["12%", "18%", "16%", "20%"], "answer": 0, "solution_en": "<p>Amount = 13.75 * Total time = 13.75 * 10 </p><p>= Rs. 137.5 </p><p>Amount  -  Principal = S.I = P * R * T/100 </p><p>137.5  -  125 = 125 * 10 * R/ (100 * 12) </p><p>12.5 = 25R/24</p><p>R = 12%</p>", "solution_hi": "<p>Amount = 13.75 * Total time = 13.75 * 10 </p><p>= Rs. 137.5 </p><p>Amount  -  Principal = S.I = P * R * T/100 </p><p>137.5  -  125 = 125 * 10 * R/ (100 * 12) </p><p>12.5 = 25R/24</p><p>R = 12%</p>", "marks": 1.0, "neg": 0.25}, {"q_en": "<p>A sum of Rs. 180 is lent by a child to his friend to be returned in 8 monthly installments of Rs. 24.75 each, the rate of interest is:</p>", "q_hi": "<p>&#2319;&#2325; &#2348;&#2330;&#2381;&#2330;&#2375; &#2344;&#2375; &#2309;&#2346;&#2344;&#2375; &#2342;&#2379;&#2360;&#2381;&#2340; &#2325;&#2379; 180 &#2352;&#2369;&#2346;&#2351;&#2375; &#2325;&#2368; &#2352;&#2366;&#2358;&#2367; 24.75 &#2352;&#2369;&#2346;&#2351;&#2375; &#2325;&#2368; 8 &#2350;&#2366;&#2360;&#2367;&#2325; &#2325;&#2367;&#2360;&#2381;&#2340;&#2379;&#2306; &#2350;&#2375;&#2306; &#2357;&#2366;&#2346;&#2360; &#2325;&#2352;&#2344;&#2375; &#2325;&#2375; &#2354;&#2367;&#2319; &#2313;&#2343;&#2366;&#2352; &#2342;&#2368;, &#2348;&#2381;&#2351;&#2366;&#2332; &#2325;&#2368; &#2342;&#2352; &#2361;&#2376;:</p>", "options_en": ["18%", "15%", "20%", "24%"], "options_hi": ["18%", "15%", "20%", "24%"], "answer": 1, "solution_en": "<p>Amount = 24.75 * Total time = 24.75 * 8 </p><p>= Rs. 198 </p><p>Amount  -  Principal = S.I = P * R * T/100 </p><p>198  -  180 = 180 * 8 * R/ (100 * 12) </p><p>18 = 6R/5 </p><p>R = 15% </p>", "solution_hi": "<p>Amount = 24.75 * Total time = 24.75 * 8 </p><p>= Rs. 198 </p><p>Amount  -  Principal = S.I = P * R * T/100 </p><p>198  -  180 = 180 * 8 * R/ (100 * 12) </p><p>18 = 6R/5 </p><p>R = 15% </p>", "marks": 1.0, "neg": 0.25}, {"q_en": "<p>A person borrowed 8100 at 8 % annual simple interest repayable in 3 equal annual installments. What will be the annual installment?</p>", "q_hi": "<p>&#2319;&#2325; &#2357;&#2381;&#2351;&#2325;&#2381;&#2340;&#2367; &#2344;&#2375; 8% &#2357;&#2366;&#2352;&#2381;&#2359;&#2367;&#2325; &#2360;&#2366;&#2343;&#2366;&#2352;&#2339; &#2348;&#2381;&#2351;&#2366;&#2332; &#2346;&#2352; 8100 &#2352;&#2369;&#2346;&#2351;&#2375; &#2313;&#2343;&#2366;&#2352; &#2354;&#2367;&#2319;, &#2332;&#2367;&#2360;&#2375; 3 &#2348;&#2352;&#2366;&#2348;&#2352; &#2357;&#2366;&#2352;&#2381;&#2359;&#2367;&#2325; &#2325;&#2367;&#2360;&#2381;&#2340;&#2379;&#2306; &#2350;&#2375;&#2306; &#2330;&#2369;&#2325;&#2366;&#2344;&#2366; &#2341;&#2366;&#2404; &#2357;&#2366;&#2352;&#2381;&#2359;&#2367;&#2325; &#2325;&#2367;&#2360;&#2381;&#2340; &#2325;&#2381;&#2351;&#2366; &#2361;&#2379;&#2327;&#2368;?</p>", "options_en": ["Rs. 3000", "Rs. 3100", "Rs. 2900", "Rs. 2800"], "options_hi": ["&#2352;&#2369;. 3000", "&#2352;&#2369;. 3100", "&#2352;&#2369;. 2900", "&#2352;&#2369;. 2800"], "answer": 1, "solution_en": "<p>S.I = P * R * T/100</p><p></p><p>= 8100 * 8 * 3/100</p><p></p><p>= Rs. 1944</p><p></p><p>A = Amount = 8100 + 1944 = Rs. 10044</p><p></p><p>T = Time</p><p></p><p>R = rate</p><p></p><p>Installment = (A * 100)/ [T * 100 + (Tn - 1 + Tn - 2 +  + 1) * R]</p><p></p><p>= (10044 * 100)/ [3 * 100 + (2 + 1) * 8]</p><p></p><p>= (10044 * 100)/ 324</p><p></p><p>= Rs. 3100</p><p></p><p>Hence, annual instalment = Rs. 3100</p>", "solution_hi": "<p>S.I = P * R * T/100</p><p></p><p>= 8100 * 8 * 3/100</p><p></p><p>= Rs. 1944</p><p></p><p>A = Amount = 8100 + 1944 = Rs. 10044</p><p></p><p>T = Time</p><p></p><p>R = rate</p><p></p><p>Installment = (A * 100)/ [T * 100 + (Tn - 1 + Tn - 2 +  + 1) * R]</p><p></p><p>= (10044 * 100)/ [3 * 100 + (2 + 1) * 8]</p><p></p><p>= (10044 * 100)/ 324</p><p></p><p>= Rs. 3100</p><p></p><p>Hence, annual instalment = Rs. 3100</p>", "marks": 1.0, "neg": 0.25}, {"q_en": "<p>A Bluetooth speaker is sold for Rs. 550 in cash, or under an installment plan of Rs. 250 as a down payment and Rs. 310 after one month. Find the annual rate of interest charged in the installment scheme.</p>", "q_hi": "<p>&#2319;&#2325; &#2348;&#2381;&#2354;&#2370;&#2335;&#2370;&#2341; &#2360;&#2381;&#2346;&#2368;&#2325;&#2352; 550 &#2352;&#2369;&#2346;&#2351;&#2375; &#2344;&#2325;&#2342; &#2350;&#2375;&#2306; &#2348;&#2375;&#2330;&#2366; &#2332;&#2366;&#2340;&#2366; &#2361;&#2376;, &#2351;&#2366; 250 &#2352;&#2369;&#2346;&#2351;&#2375; &#2325;&#2368; &#2309;&#2327;&#2381;&#2352;&#2367;&#2350; &#2325;&#2367;&#2360;&#2381;&#2340; &#2324;&#2352; &#2319;&#2325; &#2350;&#2361;&#2368;&#2344;&#2375; &#2348;&#2366;&#2342; 310 &#2352;&#2369;&#2346;&#2351;&#2375; &#2325;&#2368; &#2325;&#2367;&#2360;&#2381;&#2340; &#2351;&#2379;&#2332;&#2344;&#2366; &#2325;&#2375; &#2340;&#2361;&#2340; &#2348;&#2375;&#2330;&#2366; &#2332;&#2366;&#2340;&#2366; &#2361;&#2376;&#2404; &#2325;&#2367;&#2360;&#2381;&#2340; &#2351;&#2379;&#2332;&#2344;&#2366; &#2350;&#2375;&#2306; &#2354;&#2368; &#2332;&#2366;&#2344;&#2375; &#2357;&#2366;&#2354;&#2368; &#2357;&#2366;&#2352;&#2381;&#2359;&#2367;&#2325; &#2348;&#2381;&#2351;&#2366;&#2332; &#2342;&#2352; &#2332;&#2381;&#2334;&#2366;&#2340; &#2325;&#2368;&#2332;&#2367;&#2319;&#2404;</p>", "options_en": ["20%", "30%", "40%", "15%"], "options_hi": ["20%", "30%", "40%", "15%"], "answer": 2, "solution_en": "<p>Since Rs. 250 is paid upfront, the remaining Rs. 300 is the principal (P) or loan amount.</p><p>But the payment after 1 month is Rs. 310, so the interest (SI) is: 310 - 300 = Rs.10</p><p>Now,</p><p>SI = P * R * T/100</p><p>10 = 300 * R * (1/12)/100</p><p>R = 40%</p>", "solution_hi": "<p>Since Rs. 250 is paid upfront, the remaining Rs. 300 is the principal (P) or loan amount.</p><p>But the payment after 1 month is Rs. 310, so the interest (SI) is: 310 - 300 = Rs.10</p><p>Now,</p><p>SI = P * R * T/100</p><p>10 = 300 * R * (1/12)/100</p><p>R = 40%</p>", "marks": 1.0, "neg": 0.25}, {"q_en": "<p>A person 3300 borrowed at 10% annual simple interest repayable in 2 equal annual installments. What will be the annual installment?</p>", "q_hi": "<p>&#2319;&#2325; &#2357;&#2381;&#2351;&#2325;&#2381;&#2340;&#2367; &#2344;&#2375; 10% &#2357;&#2366;&#2352;&#2381;&#2359;&#2367;&#2325; &#2360;&#2366;&#2343;&#2366;&#2352;&#2339; &#2348;&#2381;&#2351;&#2366;&#2332; &#2346;&#2352; 3300 &#2352;&#2369;&#2346;&#2319; &#2313;&#2343;&#2366;&#2352; &#2354;&#2367;&#2319;, &#2332;&#2367;&#2360;&#2375; 2 &#2348;&#2352;&#2366;&#2348;&#2352; &#2357;&#2366;&#2352;&#2381;&#2359;&#2367;&#2325; &#2325;&#2367;&#2358;&#2381;&#2340;&#2379;&#2306; &#2350;&#2375;&#2306; &#2330;&#2369;&#2325;&#2366;&#2344;&#2366; &#2361;&#2376;&#2404; &#2357;&#2366;&#2352;&#2381;&#2359;&#2367;&#2325; &#2325;&#2367;&#2358;&#2381;&#2340; &#2325;&#2381;&#2351;&#2366; &#2361;&#2379;&#2327;&#2368;?</p>", "options_en": ["Rs. 1600", "Rs. 1200", "Rs. 1100", "Rs. 1400"], "options_hi": ["&#2352;&#2369;. 1600", "&#2352;&#2369;. 1200", "&#2352;&#2369;. 1100", "&#2352;&#2369;. 1400"], "answer": 0, "solution_en": "<p>Solution:</p><p>S.I = P * R * T/100</p><p>= 3300 * 10 * 2/100</p><p>= Rs. 660</p><p>A = Amount = 3300 + 660 = Rs. 3960</p><p>T = Time</p><p>R = rate</p><p>Installment = (A * 100)/ [T * 100 + (Tn  1 + Tn  2 +  + 1) * R]</p><p>= (3960 * 100)/ [2 * 100 + (1 + 1) * 10]</p><p>= (3960 * 100)/ 220</p><p>= Rs. 1600</p><p>Hence, annual instalment = Rs. 1600</p><p></p><p></p>", "solution_hi": "<p>Solution:</p><p>S.I = P * R * T/100</p><p>= 3300 * 10 * 2/100</p><p>= Rs. 660</p><p>A = Amount = 3300 + 660 = Rs. 3960</p><p>T = Time</p><p>R = rate</p><p>Installment = (A * 100)/ [T * 100 + (Tn  1 + Tn  2 +  + 1) * R]</p><p>= (3960 * 100)/ [2 * 100 + (1 + 1) * 10]</p><p>= (3960 * 100)/ 220</p><p>= Rs. 1600</p><p>Hence, annual instalment = Rs. 1600</p><p></p><p></p>", "marks": 1.0, "neg": 0.25}, {"q_en": "<p>What annual installment will discharge a debt of Rs. 6148 in four equal installments at the rate of 4% p.a. on simple interest annually?</p>", "q_hi": "<p>&#2325;&#2380;&#2344; &#2360;&#2368; &#2357;&#2366;&#2352;&#2381;&#2359;&#2367;&#2325; &#2325;&#2367;&#2360;&#2381;&#2340; 6148 &#2352;&#2369;&#2346;&#2351;&#2375; &#2325;&#2375; &#2315;&#2339; &#2325;&#2379; &#2330;&#2366;&#2352; &#2348;&#2352;&#2366;&#2348;&#2352; &#2325;&#2367;&#2360;&#2381;&#2340;&#2379;&#2306; &#2350;&#2375;&#2306; 4% &#2346;&#2381;&#2352;&#2340;&#2367; &#2357;&#2352;&#2381;&#2359; &#2325;&#2368; &#2342;&#2352; &#2360;&#2375; &#2357;&#2366;&#2352;&#2381;&#2359;&#2367;&#2325; &#2360;&#2366;&#2343;&#2366;&#2352;&#2339; &#2348;&#2381;&#2351;&#2366;&#2332; &#2346;&#2352; &#2330;&#2369;&#2325;&#2366;&#2319;&#2327;&#2368;?</p>", "options_en": ["Rs. 1250", "Rs. 1450", "Rs. 1550", "Rs. 1350"], "options_hi": ["&#2352;&#2369;. 1250", "&#2352;&#2369;. 1450", "&#2352;&#2369;. 1550", "&#2352;&#2369;. 1350"], "answer": 1, "solution_en": "<p>Solution:</p><p>A = Amount = Rs. 6148</p><p>T = Time</p><p>R = rate</p><p>Installment = (A * 100)/ [T * 100 + (Tn - 1 + Tn - 2 +  + 1) * R]</p><p>= (6148 * 100)/ [4 * 100 + (3 + 2 + 1) * 4]</p><p>= Rs. 1450</p><p>Hence, annual instalment = Rs. 1450</p><p></p>", "solution_hi": "<p>Solution:</p><p>A = Amount = Rs. 6148</p><p>T = Time</p><p>R = rate</p><p>Installment = (A * 100)/ [T * 100 + (Tn - 1 + Tn - 2 +  + 1) * R]</p><p>= (6148 * 100)/ [4 * 100 + (3 + 2 + 1) * 4]</p><p>= Rs. 1450</p><p>Hence, annual instalment = Rs. 1450</p><p></p>", "marks": 1.0, "neg": 0.25}, {"q_en": "<p>A sum of &#8377;16,310 is to be repaid in 4 equal yearly installments of &#8377;3,500 each, starting after one year. If interest is charged at simple interest, what annual rate of interest is being applied?</p>", "q_hi": "<p>$16,310 &#2325;&#2368; &#2352;&#2366;&#2358;&#2367; &#2325;&#2379; &#2319;&#2325; &#2357;&#2352;&#2381;&#2359; &#2325;&#2375; &#2348;&#2366;&#2342; $3,500 &#2325;&#2368; 4 &#2348;&#2352;&#2366;&#2348;&#2352; &#2357;&#2366;&#2352;&#2381;&#2359;&#2367;&#2325; &#2325;&#2367;&#2360;&#2381;&#2340;&#2379;&#2306; &#2350;&#2375;&#2306; &#2330;&#2369;&#2325;&#2366;&#2351;&#2366; &#2332;&#2366;&#2344;&#2366; &#2361;&#2376;&#2404; &#2351;&#2342;&#2367; &#2348;&#2381;&#2351;&#2366;&#2332; &#2360;&#2366;&#2343;&#2366;&#2352;&#2339; &#2348;&#2381;&#2351;&#2366;&#2332; &#2346;&#2352; &#2354;&#2367;&#2351;&#2366; &#2332;&#2366;&#2340;&#2366; &#2361;&#2376;, &#2340;&#2379; &#2348;&#2381;&#2351;&#2366;&#2332; &#2325;&#2368; &#2357;&#2366;&#2352;&#2381;&#2359;&#2367;&#2325; &#2342;&#2352; &#2325;&#2381;&#2351;&#2366; &#2361;&#2379;&#2327;&#2368;?</p>", "options_en": ["10", "9", "11", "12"], "options_hi": ["10", "9", "11", "12"], "answer": 2, "solution_en": "<p>let the rate of interest be y.</p><p>Total interest = (3500 x y x 3/100) + (3500 x y x 2/100) + (3500 x y x 1/100) + (3500 x y x 0/100) = 210y</p><p>Total amount paid = 3500 x 4 + 210y = Rs.14000 + 210y</p><p>Given that,</p><p>14000 + 210y = 16310</p><p>210y = 2310</p><p>y=11%</p>", "solution_hi": "<p>let the rate of interest be y.</p><p>Total interest = (3500 x y x 3/100) + (3500 x y x 2/100) + (3500 x y x 1/100) + (3500 x y x 0/100) = 210y</p><p>Total amount paid = 3500 x 4 + 210y = Rs.14000 + 210y</p><p>Given that,</p><p>14000 + 210y = 16310</p><p>210y = 2310</p><p>y=11%</p>", "marks": 1.0, "neg": 0.25}, {"q_en": "<p>What annual installment will discharge a debt of Rs. 3696 in four equal installments at the rate of 8% p.a. on simple interest annually?</p>", "q_hi": "<p>&#2325;&#2380;&#2344; &#2360;&#2368; &#2357;&#2366;&#2352;&#2381;&#2359;&#2367;&#2325; &#2325;&#2367;&#2360;&#2381;&#2340; 3696 &#2352;&#2369;&#2346;&#2351;&#2375; &#2325;&#2375; &#2315;&#2339; &#2325;&#2379; &#2330;&#2366;&#2352; &#2348;&#2352;&#2366;&#2348;&#2352; &#2325;&#2367;&#2360;&#2381;&#2340;&#2379;&#2306; &#2350;&#2375;&#2306; 8% &#2346;&#2381;&#2352;&#2340;&#2367; &#2357;&#2352;&#2381;&#2359; &#2325;&#2368; &#2342;&#2352; &#2360;&#2375; &#2360;&#2366;&#2343;&#2366;&#2352;&#2339; &#2348;&#2381;&#2351;&#2366;&#2332; &#2346;&#2352; &#2330;&#2369;&#2325;&#2366;&#2319;&#2327;&#2368;?</p>", "options_en": ["Rs. 875", "Rs. 850", "Rs. 800", "Rs. 825"], "options_hi": ["&#2352;&#2369;. 875", "&#2352;&#2369;. 850", "&#2352;&#2369;. 800", "&#2352;&#2369;. 825"], "answer": 3, "solution_en": "<p>Solution:</p><p>A = Amount = Rs. 3696</p><p>T = Time</p><p>R = rate</p><p>Installment = (A * 100)/ [T * 100 + (Tn - 1 + Tn - 2 + ... + 1) * R]</p><p>= (3696 * 100)/ [4 * 100 + (3 + 2 + 1) * 8]</p><p>= (3696 * 100)/ 448</p><p>= Rs. 825</p><p>Hence, annual instalment = Rs. 825</p><p></p>", "solution_hi": "<p>Solution:</p><p>A = Amount = Rs. 3696</p><p>T = Time</p><p>R = rate</p><p>Installment = (A * 100)/ [T * 100 + (Tn - 1 + Tn - 2 + ... + 1) * R]</p><p>= (3696 * 100)/ [4 * 100 + (3 + 2 + 1) * 8]</p><p>= (3696 * 100)/ 448</p><p>= Rs. 825</p><p>Hence, annual instalment = Rs. 825</p><p></p>", "marks": 1.0, "neg": 0.25}, {"q_en": "<p>A certain loan was returned in two equal half-yearly instalments each of Rs. 882. If the rate of interest was 10 % p.a. compounded yearly, how much was the interest paid on the loan? </p>", "q_hi": "<p>&#2319;&#2325; &#2344;&#2367;&#2358;&#2381;&#2330;&#2367;&#2340; &#2315;&#2339; &#2325;&#2379; 882 &#2352;&#2369;&#2346;&#2351;&#2375; &#2325;&#2368; &#2342;&#2379; &#2348;&#2352;&#2366;&#2348;&#2352; &#2309;&#2352;&#2381;&#2343;-&#2357;&#2366;&#2352;&#2381;&#2359;&#2367;&#2325; &#2325;&#2367;&#2360;&#2381;&#2340;&#2379;&#2306; &#2350;&#2375;&#2306; &#2357;&#2366;&#2346;&#2360; &#2325;&#2367;&#2351;&#2366; &#2327;&#2351;&#2366; &#2341;&#2366;&#2404; &#2351;&#2342;&#2367; &#2348;&#2381;&#2351;&#2366;&#2332; &#2325;&#2368; &#2342;&#2352; 10% &#2346;&#2381;&#2352;&#2340;&#2367; &#2357;&#2352;&#2381;&#2359; &#2341;&#2368; &#2332;&#2379; &#2357;&#2366;&#2352;&#2381;&#2359;&#2367;&#2325; &#2352;&#2370;&#2346; &#2360;&#2375; &#2360;&#2306;&#2351;&#2379;&#2332;&#2367;&#2340; &#2361;&#2379;&#2340;&#2368; &#2361;&#2376;, &#2340;&#2379; &#2315;&#2339; &#2346;&#2352; &#2325;&#2367;&#2340;&#2344;&#2366; &#2348;&#2381;&#2351;&#2366;&#2332; &#2342;&#2367;&#2351;&#2366; &#2327;&#2351;&#2366; &#2341;&#2366;?</p>", "options_en": ["Rs. 124", "Rs. 144", "Rs. 180", "Rs. 176"], "options_hi": ["&#2352;&#2369;. 124", "&#2352;&#2369;. 144", "&#2352;&#2369;. 180", "&#2352;&#2369;. 176"], "answer": 0, "solution_en": "<p>[In half yearly, time doubles and interest half]</p><p>10%/2 = 5% </p><p>Let the principal be Rs. P. </p><p>[P * (1 + 5/100)  -  882] (1 + 5/100) = 882 </p><p>[P * 105/100  -  882] * 105/100 = 882 </p><p>P * 105/100  -  882 = 840 </p><p>P * 105/100 = 1722 </p><p>P = Rs. 1640 </p><p>Hence, the interest paid = 882 * 2  -  1640 = Rs. 124 </p>", "solution_hi": "<p>[In half yearly, time doubles and interest half]</p><p>10%/2 = 5% </p><p>Let the principal be Rs. P. </p><p>[P * (1 + 5/100)  -  882] (1 + 5/100) = 882 </p><p>[P * 105/100  -  882] * 105/100 = 882 </p><p>P * 105/100  -  882 = 840 </p><p>P * 105/100 = 1722 </p><p>P = Rs. 1640 </p><p>Hence, the interest paid = 882 * 2  -  1640 = Rs. 124 </p>", "marks": 1.0, "neg": 0.25}, {"q_en": "<p>A person wants to buy a laptop. The laptop is priced at &#8377;1500 if paid in full upfront. Alternatively, the person can make a down payment of &#8377;350 and pay the remaining amount in three equal monthly installments of &#8377;400 each. Calculate the rate of simple interest charged on the installment plan.</p>", "q_hi": "<p>&#2319;&#2325; &#2357;&#2381;&#2351;&#2325;&#2381;&#2340;&#2367; &#2354;&#2376;&#2346;&#2335;&#2377;&#2346; &#2326;&#2352;&#2368;&#2342;&#2344;&#2366; &#2330;&#2366;&#2361;&#2340;&#2366; &#2361;&#2376;&#2404; &#2354;&#2376;&#2346;&#2335;&#2377;&#2346; &#2325;&#2368; &#2325;&#2368;&#2350;&#2340; 1500 &#2352;&#2369;&#2346;&#2351;&#2375; &#2361;&#2376;, &#2309;&#2327;&#2352; &#2357;&#2361; &#2346;&#2370;&#2352;&#2366; &#2349;&#2369;&#2327;&#2340;&#2366;&#2344; &#2346;&#2361;&#2354;&#2375; &#2361;&#2368; &#2325;&#2352; &#2342;&#2375;&#2404; &#2357;&#2376;&#2325;&#2354;&#2381;&#2346;&#2367;&#2325; &#2352;&#2370;&#2346; &#2360;&#2375;, &#2357;&#2381;&#2351;&#2325;&#2381;&#2340;&#2367; 350 &#2352;&#2369;&#2346;&#2351;&#2375; &#2325;&#2366; &#2309;&#2327;&#2381;&#2352;&#2367;&#2350; &#2349;&#2369;&#2327;&#2340;&#2366;&#2344; &#2325;&#2352; &#2360;&#2325;&#2340;&#2366; &#2361;&#2376; &#2324;&#2352; &#2358;&#2375;&#2359; &#2352;&#2366;&#2358;&#2367; 400 &#2352;&#2369;&#2346;&#2351;&#2375; &#2325;&#2368; &#2340;&#2368;&#2344; &#2348;&#2352;&#2366;&#2348;&#2352; &#2350;&#2366;&#2360;&#2367;&#2325; &#2325;&#2367;&#2360;&#2381;&#2340;&#2379;&#2306; &#2350;&#2375;&#2306; &#2330;&#2369;&#2325;&#2366; &#2360;&#2325;&#2340;&#2366; &#2361;&#2376;&#2404; &#2325;&#2367;&#2360;&#2381;&#2340; &#2351;&#2379;&#2332;&#2344;&#2366; &#2346;&#2352; &#2354;&#2327;&#2366;&#2319; &#2327;&#2319; &#2360;&#2366;&#2343;&#2366;&#2352;&#2339; &#2348;&#2381;&#2351;&#2366;&#2332; &#2325;&#2368; &#2342;&#2352; &#2325;&#2368; &#2327;&#2339;&#2344;&#2366; &#2325;&#2352;&#2375;&#2306;&#2404;</p>", "options_en": ["24%", "26.66%", "13.33%", "30%"], "options_hi": ["24%", "26.66%", "13.33%", "30%"], "answer": 1, "solution_en": "<p>Total amount paid in instalments = 3 * 400 = Rs.1200</p><p>Total amount paid = 350 + 1200 = Rs.1550</p><p>Interest paid = 1550 - 1500 = Rs.50</p><p>Principal for the 1st month = (1500 - 350) = Rs.1150</p><p>Principal for the 2nd month = (1150 - 400) = Rs.750</p><p>Principal for the 3rd month = (750 - 400) = Rs.350</p><p>Total principal for one month = 1150 + 750 + 350 = Rs.2250</p><p>SI = P * R * T/100</p><p>50 = 2250 * R * 1/1200</p><p>R = 26.66%</p><p></p><p></p><p></p>", "solution_hi": "<p>Total amount paid in instalments = 3 * 400 = Rs.1200</p><p>Total amount paid = 350 + 1200 = Rs.1550</p><p>Interest paid = 1550 - 1500 = Rs.50</p><p>Principal for the 1st month = (1500 - 350) = Rs.1150</p><p>Principal for the 2nd month = (1150 - 400) = Rs.750</p><p>Principal for the 3rd month = (750 - 400) = Rs.350</p><p>Total principal for one month = 1150 + 750 + 350 = Rs.2250</p><p>SI = P * R * T/100</p><p>50 = 2250 * R * 1/1200</p><p>R = 26.66%</p><p></p><p></p><p></p>", "marks": 1.0, "neg": 0.25}, {"q_en": "<p>A certain loan was returned in two equal half-yearly instalments each of Rs. 2704. If the rate of interest was 8 % p.a. compounded yearly, how much was the interest paid on the loan? </p>", "q_hi": "<p>&#2319;&#2325; &#2344;&#2367;&#2358;&#2381;&#2330;&#2367;&#2340; &#2315;&#2339; &#2325;&#2379; 2704 &#2352;&#2369;&#2346;&#2351;&#2375; &#2325;&#2368; &#2342;&#2379; &#2348;&#2352;&#2366;&#2348;&#2352; &#2309;&#2352;&#2381;&#2343;-&#2357;&#2366;&#2352;&#2381;&#2359;&#2367;&#2325; &#2325;&#2367;&#2360;&#2381;&#2340;&#2379;&#2306; &#2350;&#2375;&#2306; &#2357;&#2366;&#2346;&#2360; &#2325;&#2367;&#2351;&#2366; &#2327;&#2351;&#2366; &#2341;&#2366;&#2404; &#2351;&#2342;&#2367; &#2348;&#2381;&#2351;&#2366;&#2332; &#2325;&#2368; &#2342;&#2352; 8% &#2346;&#2381;&#2352;&#2340;&#2367; &#2357;&#2352;&#2381;&#2359; &#2341;&#2368; &#2332;&#2379; &#2357;&#2366;&#2352;&#2381;&#2359;&#2367;&#2325; &#2352;&#2370;&#2346; &#2360;&#2375; &#2360;&#2306;&#2351;&#2379;&#2332;&#2367;&#2340; &#2361;&#2379;&#2340;&#2368; &#2361;&#2376;, &#2340;&#2379; &#2315;&#2339; &#2346;&#2352; &#2325;&#2367;&#2340;&#2344;&#2366; &#2348;&#2381;&#2351;&#2366;&#2332; &#2342;&#2367;&#2351;&#2366; &#2327;&#2351;&#2366; &#2341;&#2366;?</p>", "options_en": ["Rs. 388", "Rs. 348", "Rs. 308", "Rs. 328"], "options_hi": ["&#2352;&#2369;. 388", "&#2352;&#2369;. 348", "&#2352;&#2369;. 308", "&#2352;&#2369;. 328"], "answer": 2, "solution_en": "<p>[In half yearly, time doubles and interest half]</p><p>8%/2 = 4% </p><p>Let the principal be Rs. P. </p><p>[P * (100 + 4/100)  -  2704] * (1 + 4/100) = 2704 </p><p>[P * 104/100  -  2704] = 2600 </p><p>P * 104/100 = 5304 </p><p>P = Rs. 5100 </p><p>Hence, the interest paid = 2704 * 2  -  5100 = Rs. 308 </p>", "solution_hi": "<p>[In half yearly, time doubles and interest half]</p><p>8%/2 = 4% </p><p>Let the principal be Rs. P. </p><p>[P * (100 + 4/100)  -  2704] * (1 + 4/100) = 2704 </p><p>[P * 104/100  -  2704] = 2600 </p><p>P * 104/100 = 5304 </p><p>P = Rs. 5100 </p><p>Hence, the interest paid = 2704 * 2  -  5100 = Rs. 308 </p>", "marks": 1.0, "neg": 0.25}, {"q_en": "<p>A sum of Rs. 5000 is to be paid back in two equal annual instalments; each instalment is to be paid at the end of every year. How much is each instalment if the interest is compounded annually at 5% p.a.? (Rounded off up to two decimal places) </p>", "q_hi": "<p>5000 &#2352;&#2369;&#2346;&#2351;&#2375; &#2325;&#2368; &#2352;&#2366;&#2358;&#2367; &#2342;&#2379; &#2348;&#2352;&#2366;&#2348;&#2352; &#2357;&#2366;&#2352;&#2381;&#2359;&#2367;&#2325; &#2325;&#2367;&#2360;&#2381;&#2340;&#2379;&#2306; &#2350;&#2375;&#2306; &#2330;&#2369;&#2325;&#2366;&#2312; &#2332;&#2366;&#2344;&#2368; &#2361;&#2376;; &#2346;&#2381;&#2352;&#2340;&#2381;&#2351;&#2375;&#2325; &#2325;&#2367;&#2360;&#2381;&#2340; &#2325;&#2366; &#2349;&#2369;&#2327;&#2340;&#2366;&#2344; &#2361;&#2352; &#2360;&#2366;&#2354; &#2325;&#2375; &#2309;&#2306;&#2340; &#2350;&#2375;&#2306; &#2325;&#2367;&#2351;&#2366; &#2332;&#2366;&#2344;&#2366; &#2361;&#2376;&#2404; &#2351;&#2342;&#2367; &#2348;&#2381;&#2351;&#2366;&#2332; 5% &#2346;&#2381;&#2352;&#2340;&#2367; &#2357;&#2352;&#2381;&#2359; &#2325;&#2368; &#2342;&#2352; &#2360;&#2375; &#2357;&#2366;&#2352;&#2381;&#2359;&#2367;&#2325; &#2352;&#2370;&#2346; &#2360;&#2375; &#2360;&#2306;&#2351;&#2379;&#2332;&#2367;&#2340; &#2361;&#2379;&#2340;&#2366; &#2361;&#2376;, &#2340;&#2379; &#2346;&#2381;&#2352;&#2340;&#2381;&#2351;&#2375;&#2325; &#2325;&#2367;&#2360;&#2381;&#2340; &#2325;&#2367;&#2340;&#2344;&#2368; &#2361;&#2379;&#2327;&#2368;? (&#2342;&#2379; &#2342;&#2358;&#2350;&#2354;&#2357; &#2360;&#2381;&#2341;&#2366;&#2344;&#2379;&#2306; &#2340;&#2325; &#2346;&#2370;&#2352;&#2381;&#2339;&#2366;&#2306;&#2325;&#2367;&#2340;) </p>", "options_en": ["Rs. 2688.02", "Rs. 2692.02", "Rs. 2698.02", "Rs. 2689.02"], "options_hi": ["&#2352;&#2369;. 2688.02", "&#2352;&#2369;. 2692.02", "&#2352;&#2369;. 2698.02", "&#2352;&#2369;. 2689.02"], "answer": 3, "solution_en": "<p>Let the instalment be Rs. 'X'</p><p>[P * (1 + R/100)  -  X] * (1 + R/100) = X </p><p>[5000 * (1 + 5/100)  -  X] * (1 + 5/100) = X </p><p>[5000 * 105/100  -  X] * 105/100 = X </p><p>5000 * 21/20  -  X = 20X/21 </p><p>5000 * 21/20 = 20X/21 + X </p><p>41X/21 = 5000 * 21/20 </p><p>X = Rs. 2689.02 </p>", "solution_hi": "<p>Let the instalment be Rs. 'X'</p><p>[P * (1 + R/100)  -  X] * (1 + R/100) = X </p><p>[5000 * (1 + 5/100)  -  X] * (1 + 5/100) = X </p><p>[5000 * 105/100  -  X] * 105/100 = X </p><p>5000 * 21/20  -  X = 20X/21 </p><p>5000 * 21/20 = 20X/21 + X </p><p>41X/21 = 5000 * 21/20 </p><p>X = Rs. 2689.02 </p>", "marks": 1.0, "neg": 0.25}, {"q_en": "<p>A person wants to buy a house worth &#8377;7,50,000. He opts for a financing option where he makes a down payment and the remaining amount is financed with a simple interest rate of 10% per annum. The loan is to be repaid in 20 equal annual installments of &#8377;50,000. How much is the down payment made for the house?</p>", "q_hi": "<p>&#2319;&#2325; &#2357;&#2381;&#2351;&#2325;&#2381;&#2340;&#2367; 7,50,000 &#2337;&#2377;&#2354;&#2352; &#2350;&#2370;&#2354;&#2381;&#2351; &#2325;&#2366; &#2328;&#2352; &#2326;&#2352;&#2368;&#2342;&#2344;&#2366; &#2330;&#2366;&#2361;&#2340;&#2366; &#2361;&#2376;&#2404; &#2357;&#2361; &#2319;&#2325; &#2357;&#2367;&#2340;&#2381;&#2340;&#2346;&#2379;&#2359;&#2339; &#2357;&#2367;&#2325;&#2354;&#2381;&#2346; &#2330;&#2369;&#2344;&#2340;&#2366; &#2361;&#2376;, &#2332;&#2367;&#2360;&#2350;&#2375;&#2306; &#2357;&#2361; &#2337;&#2366;&#2313;&#2344; &#2346;&#2375;&#2350;&#2375;&#2306;&#2335; &#2325;&#2352;&#2340;&#2366; &#2361;&#2376; &#2324;&#2352; &#2358;&#2375;&#2359; &#2352;&#2366;&#2358;&#2367; 10% &#2346;&#2381;&#2352;&#2340;&#2367; &#2357;&#2352;&#2381;&#2359; &#2325;&#2368; &#2360;&#2366;&#2343;&#2366;&#2352;&#2339; &#2348;&#2381;&#2351;&#2366;&#2332; &#2342;&#2352; &#2360;&#2375; &#2357;&#2367;&#2340;&#2381;&#2340;&#2346;&#2379;&#2359;&#2367;&#2340; &#2361;&#2379;&#2340;&#2368; &#2361;&#2376;&#2404; &#2315;&#2339; &#2325;&#2379; 50,000 &#2337;&#2377;&#2354;&#2352; &#2325;&#2368; 20 &#2348;&#2352;&#2366;&#2348;&#2352; &#2357;&#2366;&#2352;&#2381;&#2359;&#2367;&#2325; &#2325;&#2367;&#2360;&#2381;&#2340;&#2379;&#2306; &#2350;&#2375;&#2306; &#2330;&#2369;&#2325;&#2366;&#2351;&#2366; &#2332;&#2366;&#2344;&#2366; &#2361;&#2376;&#2404; &#2328;&#2352; &#2325;&#2375; &#2354;&#2367;&#2319; &#2337;&#2366;&#2313;&#2344; &#2346;&#2375;&#2350;&#2375;&#2306;&#2335; &#2325;&#2367;&#2340;&#2344;&#2366; &#2361;&#2376;?</p>", "options_en": ["Rs. 416666.67", "Rs. 426666.67", "Rs. 448888.89", "Rs. 448827.15"], "options_hi": ["&#2352;&#2369;. 416666.67", "&#2352;&#2369;. 426666.67", "&#2352;&#2369;. 448888.89", "&#2352;&#2369;. 448827.15"], "answer": 0, "solution_en": "<p>Total amount paid = 20 x 50000 = Rs.1000000</p><p>Let the principal amount be Rs.P</p><p>Total amount paid = Principal + SI</p><p>1000000 = P + SI</p><p>1000000 = P + (P x 10 x 20/100)</p><p>P = 1000000/3</p><p>P = Rs. 333333.33</p><p>Down payment = House price - Principal amount</p><p>Down payment = 750000 - 333333.33 = Rs.416666.67</p>", "solution_hi": "<p>Total amount paid = 20 x 50000 = Rs.1000000</p><p>Let the principal amount be Rs.P</p><p>Total amount paid = Principal + SI</p><p>1000000 = P + SI</p><p>1000000 = P + (P x 10 x 20/100)</p><p>P = 1000000/3</p><p>P = Rs. 333333.33</p><p>Down payment = House price - Principal amount</p><p>Down payment = 750000 - 333333.33 = Rs.416666.67</p>", "marks": 1.0, "neg": 0.25}, {"q_en": "<p>A man borrowed some money and returned it in two equal installments of Rs. 2205 each. If the rate of interest is 5% per annum, compounded annually, find the sum borrowed. </p>", "q_hi": "<p>&#2319;&#2325; &#2357;&#2381;&#2351;&#2325;&#2381;&#2340;&#2367; &#2344;&#2375; &#2325;&#2369;&#2331; &#2346;&#2376;&#2360;&#2375; &#2313;&#2343;&#2366;&#2352; &#2354;&#2367;&#2319; &#2324;&#2352; &#2313;&#2360;&#2375; 2205 &#2352;&#2369;&#2346;&#2351;&#2375; &#2325;&#2368; &#2342;&#2379; &#2348;&#2352;&#2366;&#2348;&#2352; &#2325;&#2367;&#2360;&#2381;&#2340;&#2379;&#2306; &#2350;&#2375;&#2306; &#2354;&#2380;&#2335;&#2366; &#2342;&#2367;&#2351;&#2366;&#2404; &#2351;&#2342;&#2367; &#2348;&#2381;&#2351;&#2366;&#2332; &#2325;&#2368; &#2342;&#2352; 5% &#2346;&#2381;&#2352;&#2340;&#2367; &#2357;&#2352;&#2381;&#2359; &#2361;&#2376;, &#2332;&#2379; &#2357;&#2366;&#2352;&#2381;&#2359;&#2367;&#2325; &#2352;&#2370;&#2346; &#2360;&#2375; &#2360;&#2306;&#2351;&#2379;&#2332;&#2367;&#2340; &#2361;&#2379;&#2340;&#2368; &#2361;&#2376;, &#2340;&#2379; &#2313;&#2343;&#2366;&#2352; &#2354;&#2368; &#2327;&#2312; &#2352;&#2366;&#2358;&#2367; &#2332;&#2381;&#2334;&#2366;&#2340; &#2325;&#2368;&#2332;&#2367;&#2319;&#2404;</p>", "options_en": ["Rs. 4500", "Rs. 4100", "Rs. 4400", "Rs. 4200"], "options_hi": ["&#2352;&#2369;. 4500", "&#2352;&#2369;. 4100", "&#2352;&#2369;. 4400", "&#2352;&#2369;. 4200"], "answer": 1, "solution_en": "<p>Let the principal be Rs. P. </p><p>[P * (1 + R/100)  -  2205] * (1 + R/100) = 2205 </p><p>[P * (1 + 5/100)  -  2205] * (1 + 5/100) = 2205 </p><p>[P * 105/100  -  2205] * 105/100 = 2205 </p><p>P * 21/20  -  2205 = 2100 </p><p>P * 21/20 = 4305 </p><p>P = Rs. 4100 </p>", "solution_hi": "<p>Let the principal be Rs. P. </p><p>[P * (1 + R/100)  -  2205] * (1 + R/100) = 2205 </p><p>[P * (1 + 5/100)  -  2205] * (1 + 5/100) = 2205 </p><p>[P * 105/100  -  2205] * 105/100 = 2205 </p><p>P * 21/20  -  2205 = 2100 </p><p>P * 21/20 = 4305 </p><p>P = Rs. 4100 </p>", "marks": 1.0, "neg": 0.25}, {"q_en": "<p>David borrowed &#8377;20,000 at 10% simple interest per annum. He made the following payments towards the loan: &#8377;4,000 after 1 year, &#8377;3,800 after 2 years, and the remaining amount after 3 years. The interest is charged on the reducing balance. What was the amount David paid as the final installment?</p>", "q_hi": "<p>&#2337;&#2375;&#2357;&#2367;&#2337; &#2344;&#2375; 10% &#2346;&#2381;&#2352;&#2340;&#2367; &#2357;&#2352;&#2381;&#2359; &#2360;&#2366;&#2343;&#2366;&#2352;&#2339; &#2348;&#2381;&#2351;&#2366;&#2332; &#2346;&#2352; 20,000 &#2337;&#2377;&#2354;&#2352; &#2313;&#2343;&#2366;&#2352; &#2354;&#2367;&#2319;&#2404; &#2313;&#2360;&#2344;&#2375; &#2315;&#2339; &#2325;&#2375; &#2354;&#2367;&#2319; &#2344;&#2367;&#2350;&#2381;&#2344;&#2354;&#2367;&#2326;&#2367;&#2340; &#2349;&#2369;&#2327;&#2340;&#2366;&#2344; &#2325;&#2367;&#2319;: 1 &#2357;&#2352;&#2381;&#2359; &#2325;&#2375; &#2348;&#2366;&#2342; 4,000 &#2337;&#2377;&#2354;&#2352;, 2 &#2357;&#2352;&#2381;&#2359; &#2325;&#2375; &#2348;&#2366;&#2342; 3,800 &#2337;&#2377;&#2354;&#2352; &#2324;&#2352; &#2358;&#2375;&#2359; &#2352;&#2366;&#2358;&#2367; 3 &#2357;&#2352;&#2381;&#2359; &#2325;&#2375; &#2348;&#2366;&#2342;&#2404; &#2348;&#2381;&#2351;&#2366;&#2332; &#2328;&#2335;&#2340;&#2368; &#2358;&#2375;&#2359; &#2352;&#2366;&#2358;&#2367; &#2346;&#2352; &#2354;&#2327;&#2366;&#2351;&#2366; &#2332;&#2366;&#2340;&#2366; &#2361;&#2376;&#2404; &#2337;&#2375;&#2357;&#2367;&#2337; &#2344;&#2375; &#2309;&#2306;&#2340;&#2367;&#2350; &#2325;&#2367;&#2360;&#2381;&#2340; &#2325;&#2375; &#2352;&#2370;&#2346; &#2350;&#2375;&#2306; &#2325;&#2367;&#2340;&#2344;&#2368; &#2352;&#2366;&#2358;&#2367; &#2325;&#2366; &#2349;&#2369;&#2327;&#2340;&#2366;&#2344; &#2325;&#2367;&#2351;&#2366;?</p>", "options_en": ["Rs. 13380", "Rs. 23320", "Rs. 17600", "Rs. 23300"], "options_hi": ["&#2352;&#2369;. 13380", "&#2352;&#2369;. 23320", "&#2352;&#2369;. 17600", "&#2352;&#2369;. 23300"], "answer": 2, "solution_en": "<p>After 1st Year:</p><p>Interest for 1st year = 10% of &#8377;20,000 = &#8377;2,000</p><p>Total due after 1 year = &#8377;20,000 + &#8377;2,000 = &#8377;22,000</p><p>Payment made = &#8377;4,000</p><p>Remaining balance = &#8377;22,000 - &#8377;4,000 = &#8377;18,000</p><p>After 2nd Year:</p><p>Interest for 2nd year = 10% of &#8377;18,000 = &#8377;1,800</p><p>Total due after 2nd year = &#8377;18,000 + &#8377;1,800 = &#8377;19,800</p><p>Payment made = &#8377;3,800</p><p>Remaining balance = &#8377;19,800 - &#8377;3,800 = &#8377;16,000</p><p>After 3rd Year:</p><p>Interest for 3rd year = 10% of &#8377;16,000 = &#8377;1,600</p><p>Total due after 3rd year = &#8377;16,000 + &#8377;1,600 = &#8377;17,600</p><p>David paid &#8377;17,600 as the final installment.</p>", "solution_hi": "<p>After 1st Year:</p><p>Interest for 1st year = 10% of &#8377;20,000 = &#8377;2,000</p><p>Total due after 1 year = &#8377;20,000 + &#8377;2,000 = &#8377;22,000</p><p>Payment made = &#8377;4,000</p><p>Remaining balance = &#8377;22,000 - &#8377;4,000 = &#8377;18,000</p><p>After 2nd Year:</p><p>Interest for 2nd year = 10% of &#8377;18,000 = &#8377;1,800</p><p>Total due after 2nd year = &#8377;18,000 + &#8377;1,800 = &#8377;19,800</p><p>Payment made = &#8377;3,800</p><p>Remaining balance = &#8377;19,800 - &#8377;3,800 = &#8377;16,000</p><p>After 3rd Year:</p><p>Interest for 3rd year = 10% of &#8377;16,000 = &#8377;1,600</p><p>Total due after 3rd year = &#8377;16,000 + &#8377;1,600 = &#8377;17,600</p><p>David paid &#8377;17,600 as the final installment.</p>", "marks": 1.0, "neg": 0.25}, {"q_en": "<p>A loan of Rs. 7800 is to be paid back in two equal half-yearly installments. How much is each installment if the interest is compounded half-yearly at 16 % per annum? </p>", "q_hi": "<p>7800 &#2352;&#2369;&#2346;&#2319; &#2325;&#2366; &#2315;&#2339; &#2342;&#2379; &#2348;&#2352;&#2366;&#2348;&#2352; &#2309;&#2352;&#2381;&#2343;-&#2357;&#2366;&#2352;&#2381;&#2359;&#2367;&#2325; &#2325;&#2367;&#2358;&#2381;&#2340;&#2379;&#2306; &#2350;&#2375;&#2306; &#2330;&#2369;&#2325;&#2366;&#2351;&#2366; &#2332;&#2366;&#2344;&#2366; &#2361;&#2376;&#2404; &#2351;&#2342;&#2367; &#2348;&#2381;&#2351;&#2366;&#2332; 16% &#2346;&#2381;&#2352;&#2340;&#2367; &#2357;&#2352;&#2381;&#2359; &#2325;&#2368; &#2342;&#2352; &#2360;&#2375; &#2309;&#2352;&#2381;&#2343;-&#2357;&#2366;&#2352;&#2381;&#2359;&#2367;&#2325; &#2352;&#2370;&#2346; &#2360;&#2375; &#2360;&#2306;&#2351;&#2379;&#2332;&#2367;&#2340; &#2361;&#2379;&#2340;&#2366; &#2361;&#2376;, &#2340;&#2379; &#2346;&#2381;&#2352;&#2340;&#2381;&#2351;&#2375;&#2325; &#2325;&#2367;&#2358;&#2381;&#2340; &#2325;&#2367;&#2340;&#2344;&#2368; &#2361;&#2379;&#2327;&#2368;?</p>", "options_en": ["Rs. 4395", "Rs. 4280", "Rs. 4275", "Rs. 4374"], "options_hi": ["&#2352;&#2369;. 4395", "&#2352;&#2369;. 4280", "&#2352;&#2369;. 4275", "&#2352;&#2369;. 4374"], "answer": 3, "solution_en": "<p>[In half yearly, time doubles and interest half]</p><p>16%/2 = 8% </p><p>Let the instalment be Rs. 'X'</p><p>[P * (1 + R/100)  -  X] * (1 + R/100) = X </p><p>[7800 * (1 + 8/100)  -  X] * (1 + 8/100) = X </p><p>[7800 * 108/100  -  X] * 108/100 = X </p><p>7800 * 27/25  -  X = X * 25/27 </p><p>7800 * 27/25 = 25X/27 + X </p><p>52X/27 = 7800 * 27/25 </p><p>X = Rs. 4374 </p>", "solution_hi": "<p>[In half yearly, time doubles and interest half]</p><p>16%/2 = 8% </p><p>Let the instalment be Rs. 'X'</p><p>[P * (1 + R/100)  -  X] * (1 + R/100) = X </p><p>[7800 * (1 + 8/100)  -  X] * (1 + 8/100) = X </p><p>[7800 * 108/100  -  X] * 108/100 = X </p><p>7800 * 27/25  -  X = X * 25/27 </p><p>7800 * 27/25 = 25X/27 + X </p><p>52X/27 = 7800 * 27/25 </p><p>X = Rs. 4374 </p>", "marks": 1.0, "neg": 0.25}, {"q_en": "<p>Amit takes a loan of Rs. 75000 at an interest rate of 20% compound interest, compounded annually. She agrees to pay two equal installments in 2 years, one installment at the end of each year. Find the value of each instalment. (Round off to the nearest integer) </p>", "q_hi": "<p>&#2309;&#2350;&#2367;&#2340; &#2344;&#2375; 20% &#2357;&#2366;&#2352;&#2381;&#2359;&#2367;&#2325; &#2330;&#2325;&#2381;&#2352;&#2357;&#2371;&#2342;&#2381;&#2343;&#2367; &#2348;&#2381;&#2351;&#2366;&#2332; &#2342;&#2352; &#2346;&#2352; 75000 &#2352;&#2369;&#2346;&#2351;&#2375; &#2325;&#2366; &#2315;&#2339; &#2354;&#2367;&#2351;&#2366;&#2404; &#2357;&#2361; 2 &#2357;&#2352;&#2381;&#2359;&#2379;&#2306; &#2350;&#2375;&#2306; &#2342;&#2379; &#2348;&#2352;&#2366;&#2348;&#2352; &#2325;&#2367;&#2358;&#2381;&#2340;&#2379;&#2306; &#2325;&#2366; &#2349;&#2369;&#2327;&#2340;&#2366;&#2344; &#2325;&#2352;&#2344;&#2375; &#2325;&#2375; &#2354;&#2367;&#2319; &#2360;&#2361;&#2350;&#2340; &#2361;&#2376;, &#2346;&#2381;&#2352;&#2340;&#2381;&#2351;&#2375;&#2325; &#2357;&#2352;&#2381;&#2359; &#2325;&#2375; &#2309;&#2306;&#2340; &#2350;&#2375;&#2306; &#2319;&#2325; &#2325;&#2367;&#2358;&#2381;&#2340;&#2404; &#2346;&#2381;&#2352;&#2340;&#2381;&#2351;&#2375;&#2325; &#2325;&#2367;&#2358;&#2381;&#2340; &#2325;&#2366; &#2350;&#2370;&#2354;&#2381;&#2351; &#2332;&#2381;&#2334;&#2366;&#2340; &#2325;&#2352;&#2375;&#2306;&#2404; (&#2344;&#2367;&#2325;&#2335;&#2340;&#2350; &#2346;&#2370;&#2352;&#2381;&#2339;&#2366;&#2306;&#2325; &#2340;&#2325; &#2346;&#2370;&#2352;&#2381;&#2339;&#2366;&#2306;&#2325;&#2367;&#2340; &#2325;&#2352;&#2375;&#2306;) </p>", "options_en": ["Rs. 49090.90", "Rs. 4808.990", "Rs. 48888.80", "Rs. 49999.90"], "options_hi": ["&#2352;&#2369;.49090.90", "&#2352;&#2369;. 4808.990", "&#2352;&#2369;. 48888.80", "&#2352;&#2369;. 49999.90"], "answer": 0, "solution_en": "<p>Let the instalment be Rs. 'X'</p><p>[P * (1 + R/100)  -  X] * (1 + R/100) = X </p><p>[75000 * (1 + 20/100)  -  X] * (1 + 20/100) = X </p><p>[75000 * 120/100  -  X] * 120/100 = X </p><p>[75000 * 6/5  -  X] * 6/5 = X </p><p>75000 * 6/5  -  X = 5X/6 </p><p>75000 * 6/5 = 11X/6 </p><p>X = Rs. 49090.90 </p>", "solution_hi": "<p>Let the instalment be Rs. 'X'</p><p>[P * (1 + R/100)  -  X] * (1 + R/100) = X </p><p>[75000 * (1 + 20/100)  -  X] * (1 + 20/100) = X </p><p>[75000 * 120/100  -  X] * 120/100 = X </p><p>[75000 * 6/5  -  X] * 6/5 = X </p><p>75000 * 6/5  -  X = 5X/6 </p><p>75000 * 6/5 = 11X/6 </p><p>X = Rs. 49090.90 </p>", "marks": 1.0, "neg": 0.25}, {"q_en": "<p>At the Hero Training Academy, Ansh borrows &#8377;90,000 from the Vault of Valor to upgrade her gear. The academy charges an annual compound interest of 8%, with the amount to be repaid in two equal installments-one at the end of each year for two years. As part of her financial training, Ansh needs to calculate the value of each installment. What should be the amount she pays annually to fully repay the loan? (Round off to the nearest whole number.)</p>", "q_hi": "<p>&#2361;&#2368;&#2352;&#2379; &#2335;&#2381;&#2352;&#2375;&#2344;&#2367;&#2306;&#2327; &#2309;&#2325;&#2366;&#2342;&#2350;&#2368; &#2350;&#2375;&#2306;, &#2309;&#2306;&#2358; &#2344;&#2375; &#2309;&#2346;&#2344;&#2375; &#2327;&#2367;&#2351;&#2352; &#2325;&#2379; &#2309;&#2346;&#2327;&#2381;&#2352;&#2375;&#2337; &#2325;&#2352;&#2344;&#2375; &#2325;&#2375; &#2354;&#2367;&#2319; &#2357;&#2377;&#2354;&#2381;&#2335; &#2321;&#2347;&#2364; &#2357;&#2376;&#2354;&#2379;&#2352; &#2360;&#2375; 90,000 &#2337;&#2377;&#2354;&#2352; &#2313;&#2343;&#2366;&#2352; &#2354;&#2367;&#2319;&#2404; &#2309;&#2325;&#2366;&#2342;&#2350;&#2368; 8% &#2325;&#2366; &#2357;&#2366;&#2352;&#2381;&#2359;&#2367;&#2325; &#2330;&#2325;&#2381;&#2352;&#2357;&#2371;&#2342;&#2381;&#2343;&#2367; &#2348;&#2381;&#2351;&#2366;&#2332; &#2354;&#2375;&#2340;&#2368; &#2361;&#2376;, &#2332;&#2367;&#2360;&#2325;&#2368; &#2352;&#2366;&#2358;&#2367; &#2342;&#2379; &#2348;&#2352;&#2366;&#2348;&#2352; &#2325;&#2367;&#2360;&#2381;&#2340;&#2379;&#2306; &#2350;&#2375;&#2306; &#2330;&#2369;&#2325;&#2366;&#2312; &#2332;&#2366;&#2344;&#2368; &#2361;&#2376;- &#2319;&#2325; &#2342;&#2379; &#2360;&#2366;&#2354; &#2325;&#2375; &#2354;&#2367;&#2319; &#2346;&#2381;&#2352;&#2340;&#2381;&#2351;&#2375;&#2325; &#2357;&#2352;&#2381;&#2359; &#2325;&#2375; &#2309;&#2306;&#2340; &#2350;&#2375;&#2306;&#2404; &#2309;&#2346;&#2344;&#2375; &#2357;&#2367;&#2340;&#2381;&#2340;&#2368;&#2351; &#2346;&#2381;&#2352;&#2358;&#2367;&#2325;&#2381;&#2359;&#2339; &#2325;&#2375; &#2361;&#2367;&#2360;&#2381;&#2360;&#2375; &#2325;&#2375; &#2352;&#2370;&#2346; &#2350;&#2375;&#2306;, &#2309;&#2306;&#2358; &#2325;&#2379; &#2346;&#2381;&#2352;&#2340;&#2381;&#2351;&#2375;&#2325; &#2325;&#2367;&#2360;&#2381;&#2340; &#2325;&#2375; &#2350;&#2370;&#2354;&#2381;&#2351; &#2325;&#2368; &#2327;&#2339;&#2344;&#2366; &#2325;&#2352;&#2344;&#2375; &#2325;&#2368; &#2310;&#2357;&#2358;&#2381;&#2351;&#2325;&#2340;&#2366; &#2361;&#2376;&#2404; &#2315;&#2339; &#2325;&#2379; &#2346;&#2370;&#2352;&#2368; &#2340;&#2352;&#2361; &#2360;&#2375; &#2330;&#2369;&#2325;&#2366;&#2344;&#2375; &#2325;&#2375; &#2354;&#2367;&#2319; &#2313;&#2360;&#2375; &#2360;&#2366;&#2354;&#2366;&#2344;&#2366; &#2325;&#2367;&#2340;&#2344;&#2368; &#2352;&#2366;&#2358;&#2367; &#2325;&#2366; &#2349;&#2369;&#2327;&#2340;&#2366;&#2344; &#2325;&#2352;&#2344;&#2366; &#2330;&#2366;&#2361;&#2367;&#2319;? (&#2344;&#2367;&#2325;&#2335;&#2340;&#2350; &#2346;&#2370;&#2352;&#2381;&#2339; &#2360;&#2306;&#2326;&#2381;&#2351;&#2366; &#2350;&#2375;&#2306; &#2346;&#2370;&#2352;&#2381;&#2339;&#2366;&#2306;&#2325;&#2367;&#2340; &#2325;&#2352;&#2375;&#2306;&#2404;)</p>", "options_en": ["Rs. 50529.23", "Rs. 50469.23", "Rs. 50789.23", "Rs. 50889.23"], "options_hi": ["&#2352;&#2369;. 50529.23", "&#2352;&#2369;.50469.23", "&#2352;&#2369;.50789.23", "&#2352;&#2369;.50889.23"], "answer": 1, "solution_en": "<p>Let the instalment be Rs. 'X'</p><p>[P * (1 + R/100)  -  X] * (1 + R/100) = X </p><p>[90000 * (1 + 8/100)  -  X] * (1 + 8/100) = X </p><p>[90000 * 108/100  -  X] * 108/100 = X </p><p>90000 * 27/25  -  X = X * 25/27 </p><p>90000 * 27/25 = 25X/27 + X </p><p>52X/27 = 90000 * 27/25 </p><p>X = Rs. 50469.23 </p>", "solution_hi": "<p>Let the instalment be Rs. 'X'</p><p>[P * (1 + R/100)  -  X] * (1 + R/100) = X </p><p>[90000 * (1 + 8/100)  -  X] * (1 + 8/100) = X </p><p>[90000 * 108/100  -  X] * 108/100 = X </p><p>90000 * 27/25  -  X = X * 25/27 </p><p>90000 * 27/25 = 25X/27 + X </p><p>52X/27 = 90000 * 27/25 </p><p>X = Rs. 50469.23 </p>", "marks": 1.0, "neg": 0.25}, {"q_en": "<p>Riya decided to buy a Scooty that cost Rs.45000. The shopkeeper agreed to sell the Scooty under the condition of Rs. 35000 cash down payment of Rs. 2700 each month for four months. Find the rate of interest at which the shopkeeper sold the Scooty under the installment scheme. (Round off to the nearest integer) </p>", "q_hi": "<p>&#2352;&#2367;&#2351;&#2366; &#2344;&#2375; 45000 &#2352;&#2369;&#2346;&#2351;&#2375; &#2325;&#2368; &#2354;&#2366;&#2327;&#2340; &#2357;&#2366;&#2354;&#2368; &#2360;&#2381;&#2325;&#2370;&#2335;&#2368; &#2326;&#2352;&#2368;&#2342;&#2344;&#2375; &#2325;&#2366; &#2347;&#2376;&#2360;&#2354;&#2366; &#2325;&#2367;&#2351;&#2366;&#2404; &#2342;&#2369;&#2325;&#2366;&#2344;&#2342;&#2366;&#2352; &#2344;&#2375; &#2330;&#2366;&#2352; &#2350;&#2361;&#2368;&#2344;&#2375; &#2340;&#2325; &#2361;&#2352; &#2350;&#2361;&#2368;&#2344;&#2375; 2700 &#2352;&#2369;&#2346;&#2351;&#2375; &#2325;&#2366; &#2344;&#2325;&#2342; &#2309;&#2327;&#2381;&#2352;&#2367;&#2350; &#2349;&#2369;&#2327;&#2340;&#2366;&#2344; &#2325;&#2352;&#2325;&#2375; 35000 &#2352;&#2369;&#2346;&#2351;&#2375; &#2325;&#2368; &#2358;&#2352;&#2381;&#2340; &#2346;&#2352; &#2360;&#2381;&#2325;&#2370;&#2335;&#2368; &#2348;&#2375;&#2330;&#2344;&#2375; &#2346;&#2352; &#2360;&#2361;&#2350;&#2340;&#2367; &#2332;&#2340;&#2366;&#2312;&#2404; &#2342;&#2369;&#2325;&#2366;&#2344;&#2342;&#2366;&#2352; &#2344;&#2375; &#2325;&#2367;&#2360;&#2381;&#2340; &#2351;&#2379;&#2332;&#2344;&#2366; &#2325;&#2375; &#2340;&#2361;&#2340; &#2360;&#2381;&#2325;&#2370;&#2335;&#2368; &#2325;&#2379; &#2332;&#2367;&#2360; &#2348;&#2381;&#2351;&#2366;&#2332; &#2342;&#2352; &#2346;&#2352; &#2348;&#2375;&#2330;&#2366;, &#2313;&#2360;&#2375; &#2332;&#2381;&#2334;&#2366;&#2340; &#2325;&#2368;&#2332;&#2367;&#2319;&#2404; (&#2344;&#2367;&#2325;&#2335;&#2340;&#2350; &#2346;&#2370;&#2352;&#2381;&#2339;&#2366;&#2306;&#2325; &#2340;&#2325; &#2346;&#2370;&#2352;&#2381;&#2339;&#2366;&#2306;&#2325;&#2367;&#2340; &#2325;&#2352;&#2375;&#2306;) </p>", "options_en": ["38.33%", "42.33%", "40.33%", "44.33%"], "options_hi": ["38.33%", "42.33%", "40.33%", "44.33%"], "answer": 2, "solution_en": "<p>Remaining amount = 45000  -  35000 = Rs. 10000 </p><p>S.I = 2700 * 4  -  10000 = Rs. 800</p><p>P = 10000 + (10000  -  2700) + (10000  -  2700 * 2) + (10000  -  2700 * 3) </p><p>= 10000 + 7300 + 4600 + 1900 </p><p>= Rs. 23800 </p><p>Hence, required interest = 800 * 12 * 100/ (23800 * 1) </p><p>= 40.33% </p>", "solution_hi": "<p>Remaining amount = 45000  -  35000 = Rs. 10000 </p><p>S.I = 2700 * 4  -  10000 = Rs. 800</p><p>P = 10000 + (10000  -  2700) + (10000  -  2700 * 2) + (10000  -  2700 * 3) </p><p>= 10000 + 7300 + 4600 + 1900 </p><p>= Rs. 23800 </p><p>Hence, required interest = 800 * 12 * 100/ (23800 * 1) </p><p>= 40.33% </p>", "marks": 1.0, "neg": 0.25}, {"q_en": "<p>Captain Diya set her sights on a fine sea-gliding Scooty priced at &#8377;30,000 gold coins. The wily merchant of Port Paisa offered her a deal: pay &#8377;18,000 gold coins upfront from her treasure chest, and settle the remaining amount in four monthly payments of &#8377;3,250 each. Curious to know how much extra gold she was parting with, Captain Diya wants to uncover the hidden interest buried in this deal. What annual rate of interest did the merchant charge her under this installment plan? (Round off your answer to the nearest whole number.)</p>", "q_hi": "<p>&#2325;&#2376;&#2346;&#2381;&#2335;&#2344; &#2342;&#2368;&#2351;&#2366; &#2344;&#2375; &#2360;&#2350;&#2369;&#2342;&#2381;&#2352; &#2350;&#2375;&#2306; &#2327;&#2381;&#2354;&#2366;&#2311;&#2337; &#2325;&#2352;&#2344;&#2375; &#2357;&#2366;&#2354;&#2368; &#2319;&#2325; &#2348;&#2338;&#2364;&#2367;&#2351;&#2366; &#2360;&#2381;&#2325;&#2370;&#2335;&#2368; &#2346;&#2352; &#2309;&#2346;&#2344;&#2368; &#2344;&#2332;&#2364;&#2352;&#2375;&#2306; &#2327;&#2337;&#2364;&#2366; &#2342;&#2368;&#2306;, &#2332;&#2367;&#2360;&#2325;&#2368; &#2325;&#2368;&#2350;&#2340; 30,000 &#2337;&#2377;&#2354;&#2352; &#2360;&#2379;&#2344;&#2375; &#2325;&#2375; &#2360;&#2367;&#2325;&#2381;&#2325;&#2375; &#2341;&#2368;&#2404; &#2346;&#2379;&#2352;&#2381;&#2335; &#2346;&#2375;&#2360;&#2366; &#2325;&#2375; &#2330;&#2366;&#2354;&#2366;&#2325; &#2357;&#2381;&#2351;&#2366;&#2346;&#2366;&#2352;&#2368; &#2344;&#2375; &#2313;&#2360;&#2375; &#2319;&#2325; &#2360;&#2380;&#2342;&#2366; &#2346;&#2375;&#2358; &#2325;&#2367;&#2351;&#2366;: &#2309;&#2346;&#2344;&#2375; &#2326;&#2332;&#2366;&#2344;&#2375; &#2360;&#2375; 18,000 &#2337;&#2377;&#2354;&#2352; &#2360;&#2379;&#2344;&#2375; &#2325;&#2375; &#2360;&#2367;&#2325;&#2381;&#2325;&#2375; &#2346;&#2361;&#2354;&#2375; &#2361;&#2368; &#2330;&#2369;&#2325;&#2366; &#2342;&#2379;, &#2324;&#2352; &#2348;&#2366;&#2325;&#2368; &#2325;&#2368; &#2352;&#2325;&#2350; 3,250 &#2337;&#2377;&#2354;&#2352; &#2325;&#2375; &#2330;&#2366;&#2352; &#2350;&#2366;&#2360;&#2367;&#2325; &#2349;&#2369;&#2327;&#2340;&#2366;&#2344;&#2379;&#2306; &#2350;&#2375;&#2306; &#2330;&#2369;&#2325;&#2366; &#2342;&#2379;&#2404; &#2351;&#2361; &#2332;&#2366;&#2344;&#2344;&#2375; &#2325;&#2375; &#2354;&#2367;&#2319; &#2313;&#2340;&#2381;&#2360;&#2369;&#2325; &#2325;&#2367; &#2357;&#2361; &#2325;&#2367;&#2340;&#2344;&#2366; &#2309;&#2340;&#2367;&#2352;&#2367;&#2325;&#2381;&#2340; &#2360;&#2379;&#2344;&#2366; &#2